OL,3,ACould El Nino mean there are no
OL,4,AAtlantic hurricanes this year?
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor the first time in more than 30
OL,7,Fyears, a hurricane has not formed in
OL,8,Fthe Atlantic throughout September -
OL,9,Fnormally the most active month for
OL,10,Fhurricane activity.
OL,12,FWith just two months left of the
OL,13,Fdefined hurricane season, there is an
OL,14,Fincreasing possibility that no
OL,15,Fhurricanes will develop at all.
OL,17,FThis would make the 2026 Atlantic
OL,18,Fhurricane season the only one in the
OL,19,Fsatellite era without a hurricane.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
