OL,3,ACould El Nino mean there are no
OL,4,AAtlantic hurricanes this year?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe biggest reason for this is El Nino,
OL,7,Fwhich traditionally stifles activity in
OL,8,Fthe Atlantic but brings a very active
OL,9,Fseason in the eastern North Pacific.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
